%% Figure 4.22 – State Machine Diagram: standard_cost_version.status (Standard Cost) · v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4
%% Same content as CrabShare_State_Machines.drawio, page "standard_cost_version.status" (generated by gen-state.js, do not edit by hand).
%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
%% Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Approved (not written by the API)" as Approved
  [*] --> Draft : / save Standard Cost · UC07
  %% / created by save Standard Cost (Owner): version_no = latest + 1 · UC07
  Draft --> Draft : save again / items replaced · UC07
  %% save again (Owner) / items and tranche plan replaced · UC07
  Draft --> Submitted : submit batch [MortalityReserve, schedule] · UC07
  %% submit batch (Owner) [MortalityReserve item, complete schedule] / submitted_at · UC07
  Submitted --> Locked : approve batch / locked_at · UC08
  %% approve batch (Admin) / locked_at, approved_by; items and plan immutable (triggers) · UC08 «planned» locked together with the price per kg and the floor price
  Submitted --> Superseded : save after request revision / new Draft · UC07, UC08
  %% save cost after request revision (Owner) / new Draft version in the same transaction · UC07, UC08
  Submitted --> [*] : batch Rejected · UC08
  %% batch Rejected (version stays Submitted) · UC08
  Submitted --> Approved : approve (not written by the API)
  %% approve (Admin) (not written by the API)
  Approved --> Locked : lock (not written by the API)
  Locked --> [*]
  Superseded --> [*]
  note right of Approved
    Approved - CHECK value (not written by the API)
  end note
  note right of Submitted
    «planned» on Submitted → Locked - locked together with the price per kg and the floor price
  end note
  note right of Draft
    «planned» settlement deducts the locked cost of the funded boxes only.
  end note
  %% Created by save Standard Cost (Owner) only if: batch Draft, no Locked version (UC07).
  %% A Locked version is the Standard Cost locked before funding (TL-11) and the settlement input (locked_standard_cost); triggers reject any change to it, its items or its tranche plan. «planned» settlement deducts the locked cost of the funded boxes only.
  %% Approved is never written by the API: only DemoLifecycleSeeder inserts Approved and then sets Locked, so that the triggers accept the items.
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class Approved notwritten
  class Locked, Superseded terminal
